name: Unapproved Review reports preparation and a durable refusal without a model request
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/prepared_dispatch_refusal.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: run triage:run {"strategy":"standard"}
require-live-snap: 25 Result · Triage findings | blocked-review
expect: blocked
expect-not: correlated result status contradicts
expect: More in Replay
expect-not: ✗ triage:run
expect: Esc result actions
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/prepared_dispatch_refusal.py @TMP_TARGET @ART blocked
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT blocked | result-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT blocked | result-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT blocked | result-80x24
expect: Owned first observation
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT blocked | result-60x20
expect: Owned first observation
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT blocked | result-40x12
expect: blocked
expect: Owned first observation
ask: Does the result show the reason once, keep the next action readable, and make full details reachable at every size?
nav-mode:
keys: o
require-live-snap: 25 ── REPLAY | compact-result-open
expect: Outcome · blocked
resize: 120x36
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 preparing model work | preparation-receipt
expect-not: calling model
expect: no model request started
ask: Does the receipt distinguish preparation from an admitted model request and explain how to prepare and approve the plan?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 25 LOGS | refusal-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 25 LOGS | refusal-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 25 LOGS | refusal-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 25 LOGS | refusal-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 25 LOGS | refusal-40x12
nav-mode:
keys: z PPage
require-live-snap: 20 allowance | refusal-small-reader
resize: 120x36
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 Owned first observation | observations-preserved
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/prepared_dispatch_refusal.py @TMP_TARGET @ART returned
ask: Can the operator read the refusal across sizes and return to the original observations without losing them or creating decisions?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
nav-mode:
keys: o
require-live-snap: 25 ── REPLAY | recovered-refusal
expect: ── REPLAY
expect: blocked
expect-not: correlated result status contradicts
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/prepared_dispatch_refusal.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart recover the same refusal with zero requests, zero decisions and no repeated work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
